                        ],
                        "form": "karmas"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "ec4a9e8c-9a8f-46a4-a4d3-850df86026a0",
                        "entry_id": "16d639fc-3f37-3fa1-841e-fe4bb1090a40",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "karman"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ac3e7c74-508b-3714-a9a9-1e7e2bbf3feb",
                        "entry_id": "16d639fc-3f37-3fa1-841e-fe4bb1090a40",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Dans plusieurs religions orientales, cycle des causes et des conséquences lié à l’existence des êtres sensibles."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Hinduism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2c104e94-3c51-4e1c-8074-5435b06eff22",
                                "sense_id": "ac3e7c74-508b-3714-a9a9-1e7e2bbf3feb",
                                "text": "Ce morceau de rocher avait surnagé par on ne sait quel caprice d’un dieu ébahi et retors, désireux de faire payer ad vitam æternam à ses habitant le karma de leurs malheureux ancêtres."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "da5ae2a2-cbfa-456c-beea-40b6d95bd1fd",
                                "sense_id": "ac3e7c74-508b-3714-a9a9-1e7e2bbf3feb",
                                "text": "Nous avons tous entendu parler de l’omniprésent moulin à prière au Tibet. Il suffit de le faire tourner en récitant le mantra (une prière) approprié pour attirer la bienveillance de divinités sur soi, purifier son karma (ses actions) et accumuler du mérite pour une future réincarnation heureuse."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bbdc6197-8fdf-3f1a-9ed1-91d54591fbb7",
                        "entry_id": "16d639fc-3f37-3fa1-841e-fe4bb1090a40",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Environnement défavorable, négatif."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "001663d1-5c0b-42ac-9a93-23103406ffea",
                                "sense_id": "bbdc6197-8fdf-3f1a-9ed1-91d54591fbb7",
                                "text": "Ainsi, trois paires d’oreilles vont être à l’écoute de mon ramage. « Very bad Karma ! » comme on le dira plus tard."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8b33acf1-6321-3089-8f12-46f4bec8e9e9",
                        "entry_id": "16d639fc-3f37-3fa1-841e-fe4bb1090a40",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Sur Reddit, score assigné à un post ou à un·e utilisataire montrant le nombre de votes positifs (upvotes) reçus."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Internet"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ad945d2d-7806-4bfb-89ee-646d0aa8475a",
                        "source_entry_id": "16d639fc-3f37-3fa1-841e-fe4bb1090a40",
                        "target_lang_word": "karma",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "karma",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5f860eba-aeae-34d0-82c1-81b498570eb1",
                                        "entry_id": "c1f7018b-0abd-3716-ade9-d25596f05aed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The sum total of a person's actions, which determine the person's next incarnation in samsara, the cycle of death and rebirth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Hinduism",
                                            "Jainism",
                                            "Sikhism",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff769e0f-e9fa-4f23-a46f-c5b254eb778b",
                                                "sense_id": "5f860eba-aeae-34d0-82c1-81b498570eb1",
                                                "text": "‘We are all part of a circle of karma. We will be rewarded for the good deeds of our forefathers, and pay the price for their sins.’"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aece5933-97fa-3b0b-b8cc-abf500086ea9",
                                        "entry_id": "c1f7018b-0abd-3716-ade9-d25596f05aed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A force or law of nature which causes one to reap what one sows; destiny; fate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab4a8657-3664-3fa6-aaba-8b4a71dc3a54",
                                        "entry_id": "c1f7018b-0abd-3716-ade9-d25596f05aed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A distinctive feeling, aura, or atmosphere."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncommon",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6be9a6e0-a3d2-4c88-9cab-855860bbd9a1",
                                                "sense_id": "ab4a8657-3664-3fa6-aaba-8b4a71dc3a54",
                                                "text": "That means everything from lighting to the vibes, the karma of the room."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8f6feff-d688-47b9-9d22-8519199c157b",
                                                "sense_id": "ab4a8657-3664-3fa6-aaba-8b4a71dc3a54",
                                                "text": "How many times when you have been in a bar have you felt that a confrontation was building up, even without extensive verbal exchanges? Sometimes you can feel the karma or energy of a place change, and you should not ignore that"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d67f774-792e-4b4d-b47a-bb1532359c60",
                                                "sense_id": "ab4a8657-3664-3fa6-aaba-8b4a71dc3a54",
                                                "text": "On the way to Lancaster, which was about an hour and a half from Philly, John felt the karma."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c6007817-9773-3efa-9ae6-f5394dea9464",
                                        "entry_id": "c1f7018b-0abd-3716-ade9-d25596f05aed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A score assigned to a user or post on some discussion forums, indicating popularity or perceived value."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
